# Glossary > Releases
# ipm-overview:docs/glossary.md#L247
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

release tag ::c, changelog ::c, pinned ref ::c --> release input ::c
extension package ::c, marketplace listing ::c --> release output ::c
gated approval ::c --> safety device ::c
write lock ::c --> safety device

release input, release output --> artifact ::c
